{"question_id":"v03_q08","tenant_id":"6184f33c-6906-4874-bb5a-fd573edb30cd","video_id":"0ccec4b2-ed55-45e6-adf7-60698182aabd","video_title":"v-3","question":"直角坐标转极坐标要使用哪些基本代换，并据此如何改写方程 x²+xy+y²=1？","answer":"使用 x=ρcosθ、y=ρsinθ 和 ρ=√(x²+y²)，代换化简后得到 ρ²(1+1/2·sin2θ)=1。","tags":["multi_evidence","math"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["38745e3f-0623-46e7-8edb-e20ee424e7e3"],["913d21b8-8d88-4e2b-8c1a-eb745d14785f"]]}
